message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Personal Control Harness (PCH)"
abstract: >-
  A harness that lets a model plan and control its own steps verifiably:
  each step is recorded in a hash-chained receipt that can be replayed and
  checked, with test beds and the LithoLattice engine and LithoKraft game.
